<template>
  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="pdx-txt-title">TreeSelect</h1>
    <p class="pdx-txt-body pdx-ink-muted intro">
      <code>&lt;pdx-tree-select&gt;</code> — select with hierarchical tree dropdown.
      Single or multi-select, search filter, expand/collapse, lazy loading.
    </p>

    <app-demo-comp-tree-select-single class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-tree-select-single>

    <app-demo-comp-tree-select-multi class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-tree-select-multi>

    <app-demo-comp-tree-select-searchable class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-tree-select-searchable>

    <app-demo-comp-tree-select-expand-all class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-tree-select-expand-all>

    <app-demo-comp-tree-select-pre-selected class="demo-section"></app-demo-comp-tree-select-pre-selected>

    <section>
      <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Slots</h2>
      <div class="options-table">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Slot</th><th>Scope</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>node</code></td><td><code>{ node, level, expanded }</code></td><td>Custom tree node label.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">Props Reference</h2>
      <div class="options-table">
        <div class="opt-header"><span>Prop</span><span>Type</span><span>Description</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>options</code><span>TreeSelectNode[]</span><span>{ value, label, children?, disabled? }</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>value</code><span>string | string[]</span><span>Selected value(s)</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>multiple</code><span>boolean</span><span>Multi-select with checkboxes</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>searchable</code><span>boolean</span><span>Show search filter</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>expandAll</code><span>boolean</span><span>Expand all nodes on open</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>loadChildren</code><span>function</span><span>Lazy: (node) => Promise&lt;TreeSelectNode[]&gt;</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>clearable</code><span>boolean</span><span>Show clear button (default: true)</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>disabled</code><span>boolean</span><span>Disabled state</span></div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="pdx-txt-subheading" style="margin-top:var(--pdx-space-lg)">Events, methods, states and parts</h3>
      <p class="pdx-txt-small pdx-ink-muted">
        The panel is driven by the overlay verbs; the selection is the model, <code>value</code>. What a theme or a page
        styles on <code>&lt;pdx-tree-select&gt;</code>: its custom states on the host and its parts. The classes inside are not public.
      </p>
      <div class="options-table">
        <div class="opt-header"><span>Event, method, state or part</span><span></span><span>What it is</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>@value-change / @open-change</code><span>{ value }</span><span>The selection changed; the panel opened or closed</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>@pdx-clear / @pdx-load-error</code><span></span><span>Cleared; <code>loadChildren</code> rejected</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>show() / close() / toggle()</code><span></span><span>Open, close, or flip the panel</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>clear() / getLabel()</code><span></span><span>Empty the selection; the selected labels</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>:state(open) / :state(disabled) / :state(loading)</code><span></span><span>The panel is open; <code>disabled</code> is set; a branch is being fetched</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>[data-part="root"] / [data-part="clear"]</code><span></span><span>The trigger; the clear button</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>[data-part="popup"] / [data-part="search"]</code><span></span><span>The panel; its search field</span></div>
        <div class="opt-row"><code>[data-part="tree"] / [data-part="node"] / [data-part="toggle"]</code><span></span><span>The tree; a node; a node's expand button</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
@page '/components/tree-select';
@title 'TreeSelect Component';
</script>

